{"title":"My Portfolio","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"My Portfolio","subtitle":"A collection of finished data science projects.","page-layout":"full","toc":false,"execute":{"echo":false,"warning":false,"message":false},"format":{"html":{"theme":"cosmo","anchor-sections":true,"smooth-scroll":true}}},"headingText":"Project 1 — A cursory look into health expenditure in Canada 2025","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n:::::::: portfolio-strip\n::: project-card\n<a class=\"card-link\" href=\"cahealthexpenditure2025.html\" aria-label=\"View Project 1\"></a>\n<h3>[Project 1]{.project-title}<br> [A cursory look into health expenditure in Canada 2025]{.project-subtitle}</h3>\n:::\n\n::: project-card\n<a class=\"card-link\" href=\"student_lifestyle_data_kaggle.qmd\" aria-label=\"View Project 1\"></a>\n<h3>[Project 2]{.project-title}<br> [Student lifestyle factors and school performance]{.project-subtitle}</h3>\n:::\n\n::: project-card\n<a class=\"card-link\" href=\"rf_tuning_cleveland.qmd\" aria-label=\"View Project 1\"></a>\n<h3>[Project 3]{.project-title}<br> [Tuning a machine learning algorithm on Cleveland dataset]{.project-subtitle}</h3>\n:::\n\n::: project-card\n<a class=\"card-link\" href=\"biomarker_slopes.qmd\" aria-label=\"View Project 1\"></a>\n<h3>[Project 4]{.project-title}<br> [Diagnostic performance using generative art]{.project-subtitle}</h3>\n:::\n\n::: project-card\n<a class=\"card-link\" href=\"tidymodels_overview.qmd\" aria-label=\"View Project 1\"></a>\n<h3>[Project 5]{.project-title}<br> [Overview of the tidymodels R-package and sample code]{.project-subtitle}</h3>\n:::\n\n<!-- more cards -->\n::::::::\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n```{=html}\n<!---\n:::::::::::::::::: grid\n::::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n:::: card\n::: card-body\n\n**Goal:** Visualizing Canadian expenditure on hospitals, physicians, medications, public health, administration, COVID-1 response and other professionals by provincial, public and private sector.\n\n**Notes:**\n\n-   From [National Health Expenditure](https://www.cihi.ca/en/national-health-expenditure-trends) Trends found on CIHI.\n\n[View output →](cahealthexpenditure2025.qmd)\n:::\n::::\n:::::\n\n::::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n:::: card\n::: card-body\n### Project 2 — Student lifestyle factors and its influence on school performance: A Kaggle dataset.\n\n**Goal:** To provide an exploratory analysis of how student lifestyles affect school performance in Portugal.\n\n**Notes:**\n\n-   Original dataset can be found on [Kaggle](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/charlottebennett1234/lifestyle-factors-and-their-impact-on-students/data).\n\n[View results](student_lifestyle_data_kaggle.qmd)[→](project-2.qmd)\n:::\n::::\n:::::\n\n::::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n:::: card\n::: card-body\n### Project 3 — Tuning a machine learning algorithm on Cleveland dataset\n\n**Goal:** Visualize optimal hyperparameter values for a random forest model.\n\n**Notes**:\n\n-   The original dataset can be found at [UC Irvine's Machine Learning Repository](https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/45/heart+disease).\n\n[View results](rf_tuning_cleveland.qmd)[→](https://github.com/YOURNAME/YOURREPO)\n:::\n::::\n:::::\n\n::::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n:::: card\n::: card-body\n### Project 4 — Diagnostic performance using generative art\n\n**Summary:** A reproduction of an analysis inspired by generative art.\\\n\n**Notes:** I have found it useful to borrow tools from artists to help describe complex data.\n\n[View output →](biomarker_slopes.qmd)\n:::\n::::\n:::::\n\n::::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n:::: card\n::: card-body\n### Project 5 — Overview of the tidymodels R-package and sample code\n\n**Summary:** The tidymodels package is designed to optimize the prevention of data leakage when training and testing machine learning models. I outline the package here.\\\n\n[View output→](tidymodels_overview.qmd)\n:::\n::::\n:::::\n::::::::::::::::::\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n--->\n```\n\n::: {.callout-tip appearance=\"simple\"}\nEmail me at zbolabs\\@gmail.com if you’d like to collaborate, chat about a project, or ask a question.\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n:::::::: portfolio-strip\n::: project-card\n<a class=\"card-link\" href=\"cahealthexpenditure2025.html\" aria-label=\"View Project 1\"></a>\n<h3>[Project 1]{.project-title}<br> [A cursory look into health expenditure in Canada 2025]{.project-subtitle}</h3>\n:::\n\n::: project-card\n<a class=\"card-link\" href=\"student_lifestyle_data_kaggle.qmd\" aria-label=\"View Project 1\"></a>\n<h3>[Project 2]{.project-title}<br> [Student lifestyle factors and school performance]{.project-subtitle}</h3>\n:::\n\n::: project-card\n<a class=\"card-link\" href=\"rf_tuning_cleveland.qmd\" aria-label=\"View Project 1\"></a>\n<h3>[Project 3]{.project-title}<br> [Tuning a machine learning algorithm on Cleveland dataset]{.project-subtitle}</h3>\n:::\n\n::: project-card\n<a class=\"card-link\" href=\"biomarker_slopes.qmd\" aria-label=\"View Project 1\"></a>\n<h3>[Project 4]{.project-title}<br> [Diagnostic performance using generative art]{.project-subtitle}</h3>\n:::\n\n::: project-card\n<a class=\"card-link\" href=\"tidymodels_overview.qmd\" aria-label=\"View Project 1\"></a>\n<h3>[Project 5]{.project-title}<br> [Overview of the tidymodels R-package and sample code]{.project-subtitle}</h3>\n:::\n\n<!-- more cards -->\n::::::::\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n```{=html}\n<!---\n:::::::::::::::::: grid\n::::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n:::: card\n::: card-body\n### Project 1 — A cursory look into health expenditure in Canada 2025\n\n**Goal:** Visualizing Canadian expenditure on hospitals, physicians, medications, public health, administration, COVID-1 response and other professionals by provincial, public and private sector.\n\n**Notes:**\n\n-   From [National Health Expenditure](https://www.cihi.ca/en/national-health-expenditure-trends) Trends found on CIHI.\n\n[View output →](cahealthexpenditure2025.qmd)\n:::\n::::\n:::::\n\n::::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n:::: card\n::: card-body\n### Project 2 — Student lifestyle factors and its influence on school performance: A Kaggle dataset.\n\n**Goal:** To provide an exploratory analysis of how student lifestyles affect school performance in Portugal.\n\n**Notes:**\n\n-   Original dataset can be found on [Kaggle](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/charlottebennett1234/lifestyle-factors-and-their-impact-on-students/data).\n\n[View results](student_lifestyle_data_kaggle.qmd)[→](project-2.qmd)\n:::\n::::\n:::::\n\n::::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n:::: card\n::: card-body\n### Project 3 — Tuning a machine learning algorithm on Cleveland dataset\n\n**Goal:** Visualize optimal hyperparameter values for a random forest model.\n\n**Notes**:\n\n-   The original dataset can be found at [UC Irvine's Machine Learning Repository](https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/45/heart+disease).\n\n[View results](rf_tuning_cleveland.qmd)[→](https://github.com/YOURNAME/YOURREPO)\n:::\n::::\n:::::\n\n::::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n:::: card\n::: card-body\n### Project 4 — Diagnostic performance using generative art\n\n**Summary:** A reproduction of an analysis inspired by generative art.\\\n\n**Notes:** I have found it useful to borrow tools from artists to help describe complex data.\n\n[View output →](biomarker_slopes.qmd)\n:::\n::::\n:::::\n\n::::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-6}\n:::: card\n::: card-body\n### Project 5 — Overview of the tidymodels R-package and sample code\n\n**Summary:** The tidymodels package is designed to optimize the prevention of data leakage when training and testing machine learning models. I outline the package here.\\\n\n[View output→](tidymodels_overview.qmd)\n:::\n::::\n:::::\n::::::::::::::::::\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n--->\n```\n\n::: {.callout-tip appearance=\"simple\"}\nEmail me at zbolabs